INSERT INTO `AboutGroups` VALUES (1,'About TIPER','data:image/jpeg;base64,','data:image/jpeg;base64,','About TIPER','<p>Since its inception, <strong>Translam Institute of Pharmaceutical Education &amp; Research (TIPER)</strong> has been a distinguished hub for quality pharmaceutical education and research excellence. The institute is dedicated to nurturing future-ready pharmacists and healthcare professionals through a blend of academic rigor, practical exposure, and ethical values.</p><p>TIPER offers well-structured diploma, undergraduate, and postgraduate pharmacy programs, all approved by the <strong>Pharmacy Council of India (PCI), New Delhi</strong>, and <strong>Affiliated to Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam Technical University and the Board of Technical Education, Lucknow.</strong> The programs are designed to meet global standards in pharmaceutical sciences and healthcare education.</p><p>With <strong>state-of-the-art laboratories, advanced research facilities, experienced faculty, and strong industry collaborations</strong>, TIPER provides a holistic learning ecosystem where students gain both theoretical knowledge and practical expertise. Emphasis is placed on innovation, patient-centered care, and community service, ensuring graduates are socially responsible and professionally competent.</p><p>Through its unwavering commitment to academic excellence, research, and social responsibility, TIPER continues to shape skilled pharmacists, researchers, and healthcare leaders, firmly establishing itself as a <strong>center of excellence in pharmaceutical education and research in Meerut and beyond</strong>.</p>','data:image/jpeg;base64,','Vision & Mission','<p>To be recognized as a leading institution in teacher education, committed to nurturing competent, ethical, and socially responsible educators who inspire lifelong learning and contribute meaningfully to the advancement of society.</p>','<p>To deliver value-based, student-centered education that seamlessly integrates academic knowledge with practical training, TIPer is dedicated to developing innovative, skilled, and empathetic educators equipped to meet the evolving demands of modern classrooms. The institute fosters a culture of research, creativity, and continuous learning in the field of education while cultivating ethical values, leadership qualities, and a strong sense of social responsibility among future teachers. Additionally, TIPer emphasizes building collaborative partnerships with schools, communities, and stakeholders to ensure the holistic development of teacher education.</p>','data:image/webp;base64,','Aims & Objectives','[\"The institute aims to prepare professionally skilled and ethically grounded educators who can effectively respond to the challenges of a dynamic and diverse education system. With a strong emphasis on values and excellence, it focuses on shaping teachers who are both competent and compassionate.\",\"We are committed to fostering holistic development by nurturing intellectual, emotional, and social competencies. This approach empowers students to become responsible global citizens, equipped to contribute meaningfully to society and the education sector.\",\"By integrating modern pedagogy with innovative practices and research-oriented learning, the institute ensures continuous improvement in the quality of education. This commitment helps future educators stay aligned with evolving academic standards and emerging trends in teaching and learning.\"]','2025-08-10 08:01:23','2025-11-26 16:47:39');
/*!40000 ALTER TABLE `AboutGroups` ENABLE KEYS */;
UNLOCK TABLES;

