INSERT INTO `Philosophies` VALUES (1,'PHILOSOPHY','data:image/jpeg;base64,','\"Empowerment begins the moment a learner believes they can shape their own futureand education lights that belief.\"  ','<p>At <strong>Translam Institute of Pharmaceutical Education &amp; Research (TIPER)</strong>, we believe that education is the most powerful and enduring force of transformationone that instills knowledge, confidence, and the ability to make a meaningful impact on society. For over 38 years, this vision has guided our journey, enabling us to nurture a new generation of competent, ethical, and innovative pharmacy professionals prepared to meet the evolving challenges of the healthcare and pharmaceutical industry.</p><p>Our philosophy blends the wisdom of tradition with the advancements of modern science, creating a holistic learning environment where academic rigor, research excellence, and practical training come together. At <strong>TIPER</strong>, diversity and inclusivity are embraced, and every program is designed to foster innovation, critical thinking, and problem-solving skills. By encouraging scientific exploration and nurturing professional values, we prepare students to lead with compassion, expertise, and responsibility in their chosen fields.</p><p>The spirit of collaboration and innovation lies at the core of <strong>TIPER</strong>where faculty, students, and researchers work together in pursuit of academic growth and societal well-being. We view pharmaceutical education not merely as a profession, but as a mission to serve humanity through knowledge, research, and ethical practice. We warmly welcome aspiring pharmacists to join the <strong>TIPER</strong> family, where our commitment is to empower todays learners into becoming tomorrows leaders, researchers, and global healthcare contributors.</p>','2025-08-10 07:58:54','2025-10-15 16:57:01');
/*!40000 ALTER TABLE `Philosophies` ENABLE KEYS */;
UNLOCK TABLES;

